WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.464 --> 00:00:03.733
She went out for a jog and never came home.

00:00:05.401 --> 00:00:07.503
How critical is a victim's last day?

00:00:13.476 --> 00:00:14.944
As you pieced that together

00:00:14.944 --> 00:00:17.981
what were you able to find out about Cassie's life?

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.420
Mollie had been gone over 24 hours.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.389
One of the biggest cases ever in Iowa.

00:00:26.389 --> 00:00:28.625
We were desperate to find Mollie.

00:00:29.158 --> 00:00:31.861
I fell to floor and I was just sobbing.

00:00:31.861 --> 00:00:33.863
I was never gonna get to hug her again.

00:00:35.231 --> 00:00:38.067
So you saw her leave the house?

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:42.005
What did you have to do to determine who your victim was?

00:00:42.005 --> 00:00:44.207
For me, she was my guardian angel.

00:00:52.215 --> 00:00:54.517
You still feel her presence, don't you?

